#: search2:search2_17E59A1E_C2AD_472F_A3C9_CA533D23C576
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d0e66787c47e6e8a312ff93260176e1a61cecbfcfbfba4d2573b4bc8a60a7fc8
#. default-sha256: bbabe182a32304ef1a7721e3c25851d8b05f63ea7961ca78d50632ba0818d2f7
msgctxt "search2:search2_17E59A1E_C2AD_472F_A3C9_CA533D23C576"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The words of one foolish woman determined the course of my entire life. ⟪k:2⟫Before I "
"was even born, my fate was decided.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Did her claim come from faith? Was it her way "
"of escaping reality? Did she do it for money? Or fame? I don’t know."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫As palavras de uma mulher tola determinaram o curso de toda a minha vida. ⟪k:2⟫Antes "
"mesmo de eu nascer, meu destino foi decidido.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Será que a reivindicação dela veio da "
"fé? Era sua maneira de escapar da realidade? Ela fez isso por dinheiro? Ou fama? Eu não sei."

#: search2:search2_1089FD7A_2480_4B50_930C_A13BD08F918B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea1868ada695761bcd77042f2f64c1ff2618f6e894b1d1a497cdf339feef20ae
#. default-sha256: c5b7c832869b9a98759f617d5698a474b590bc49b67b18199eaadb5df2fcb95b
msgctxt "search2:search2_1089FD7A_2480_4B50_930C_A13BD08F918B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The village where she lived had suffered from years of poor harvest. ⟪k:2⟫It had been "
"months since the last rain, and all the villagers prayed desperately to be blessed with succor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A aldeia onde ela morava havia sofrido com anos de colheita ruim. ⟪k:2⟫Fazia meses "
"desde a última chuva, e todos os aldeões rezavam desesperadamente para serem abençoados com "
"socorro.."

#: search2:search2_92D9C1B4_DF69_4220_8D5A_EBEDCA4D3909
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dfd02bd5d3d7b589bb416c80b03c869a54af4520440b025f86aa7ac898e93f78
#. default-sha256: d99dca83b2201e939a68854b3a249344105fbc5a917860e8c1350d866dd90508
msgctxt "search2:search2_92D9C1B4_DF69_4220_8D5A_EBEDCA4D3909"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“I am with child, though I have known no man!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Estou grávida, embora não tenha passado tempo com nenhum homem!”"

#: search2:search2_D097AA71_4A38_41C0_91E3_5AE8CB17787F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b46b3ed772c9ebc867d874b0402f17dee5483c4e514c571aedb32f35577a1019
#. default-sha256: 11610c6ae4396077a14d941426512c37a4f9616d75eae2ca053d49b9f98dfb9d
msgctxt "search2:search2_D097AA71_4A38_41C0_91E3_5AE8CB17787F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So proclaimed the pregnant woman in the midst of the drought.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫And on the "
"day of my birth, the very moment I let out my first cry,⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫a heavy rain fell down upon the "
"village.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫The storm quenched the parched earth, nourishing the crops and saving the "
"village. ⟪k:10⟫The villagers were astounded, for they had thought the drought would never end."
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫As plump drops of rain poured down upon the village, they gathered around "
"newborn me in exultation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Assim proclamou a mulher grávida no meio da seca.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫E no dia do meu "
"nascimento, no momento em que soltei meu primeiro choro,⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫uma forte chuva caiu sobre a "
"aldeia.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫A tempestade saciou a terra ressequida, alimentando as colheitas e salvando "
"a aldeia. ⟪k:10⟫Os aldeões ficaram assombrados, pois pensavam que a seca nunca iria acabar.⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫À medida que gotas pesadas de chuva caíam sobre a aldeia, eles se reuniram em torno "
"de mim recém-nascida em exultação."

#: search2:search2_97488FB8_DEDE_4B47_9455_21D6335BF989
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc3c0f50f97cd52fe50a2d996829bd23c459b239eaf478167a3d232a55ac4004
#. default-sha256: a967ff02f86538192b5057ac6f44709e40249f99230891a30b64b27f6b146184
msgctxt "search2:search2_97488FB8_DEDE_4B47_9455_21D6335BF989"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Perhaps there would be more wonder in claiming I had magical powers. ⟪k:2⟫Perhaps it "
"would make a better story if I were to say there were higher forces involved. ⟪k:3⟫But all these "
"years later, here is what I truly think:⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫It was nothing more than a fluke. "
"⟪k:8⟫An improbable stroke of luck.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫An unbelievably fortunate accident for my mother and "
"the village—⟪k:11⟫and an indescribably unfortunate accident for myself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Talvez fosse mais impressionante afirmar que eu tinha poderes mágicos. ⟪k:2⟫Talvez "
"fosse uma história melhor se eu dissesse que há forças superiores envolvidas. ⟪k:3⟫Mas todos "
"esses anos depois, aqui está o que eu realmente penso⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Não passou de um acaso. "
"⟪k:8⟫Um improvável golpe de sorte.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Um acidente inacreditavelmente feliz para minha mãe "
"e para a aldeia—⟪k:11⟫e um acidente indescritivelmente infeliz para mim."

#: search2:search2_C8331C9D_43DB_4A92_B3F6_F0917106E78F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d0936a128eab8a9680d75fdab04f30b307e1c560ff6e0f02a71018ac5394f817
#. default-sha256: a30817f8b9dacfbf516152cfd9235a681621ceac0aa6fb2cf5162a4c2bfeb4d7
msgctxt "search2:search2_C8331C9D_43DB_4A92_B3F6_F0917106E78F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Michel... the time when I lived and the time when you lived were not so different. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Our views and beliefs about the world are very much the same, ⟪k:3⟫so you should understand that "
"in our time, blood was seen as unclean. ⟪k:4⟫It was a dreadful thing, ridden with diseases, which "
"is why we drained the blood from animals and purified the flesh before consuming it.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫But being a saint, my blood would have been different. ⟪k:8⟫Like the blood of the saints who "
"came before me, mine would be blessed.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I believed it would be able to cleanse people’s "
"impurities."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Michel... a época em que eu vivi e a época em que você viveu não eram tão diferentes. "
"⟪k:2⟫Nossas visões e crenças sobre o mundo são praticamente as mesmas, ⟪k:3⟫então você deve "
"entender que em nosso tempo, o sangue era visto como impuro. ⟪k:4⟫Era uma coisa terrível, cheia "
"de doenças, por isso drenávamos o sangue dos animais e purificávamos a carne antes de consumi-la."
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Mas sendo uma santa, meu sangue seria diferente. ⟪k:8⟫Como o sangue dos santos que "
"vieram antes de mim, o meu seria abençoado.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Eu acreditava que ele seria capaz de limpar "
"as impurezas das pessoas."

#: search2:search2_4293C089_1C85_48B3_A4BD_6329F82D9EC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df882e126af645242370654b4091deae45cfe764816fe6f052961a9c7a5229b7
#. default-sha256: 982d665afd9440e9494b51bf16547a71bf2847f66c0ef7761848ecfb385dd286
msgctxt "search2:search2_4293C089_1C85_48B3_A4BD_6329F82D9EC6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But if you would give me a chance, I would like to explain myself. ⟪k:2⟫I was but a "
"young girl at the time. ⟪k:3⟫And to a child, her mother is the world. ⟪k:4⟫Anything she says is "
"the absolute truth.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫So when my mother’s claims so happened to coincide with a lucky "
"miracle, my young mind was set in stone.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫I was a saint.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫My "
"blood could heal the sick.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫And nothing would convince me otherwise.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫"
"⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫After all, I was but a girl of six years old."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mas se você me der uma chance, eu gostaria de me explicar. ⟪k:2⟫Eu era apenas uma "
"garotinha na época. ⟪k:3⟫E para uma criança, sua mãe é o mundo. ⟪k:4⟫Tudo o que ela diz é a "
"verdade absoluta.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Então, quando as reivindicações de minha mãe coincidiram com um "
"milagre fortuito, minha jovem mente foi gravada em pedra.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Eu era uma santa."
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Meu sangue podia curar os doentes.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫E nada me convenceria do "
"contrário.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Afinal, eu era apenas uma menina de seis anos."

#: search2:search2_74DF6E1C_9F3F_4A02_88FC_8F0F637CAEDB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59dc82ef26a24147ee5961781773de61b7331706204782f5aef3fd952782e9b9
#. default-sha256: 72c51a92ddf3a1a4adce7d40da31363d459832c3ed4c29f35690fbe86993f497
msgctxt "search2:search2_74DF6E1C_9F3F_4A02_88FC_8F0F637CAEDB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It didn’t take long for word of the miracle-performing child of God to spread. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Travelers from faraway lands came to our village, all in search of aid.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Driven by a "
"mixture of elation and duty, I gave my blessings unto every pilgrim who sought them. ⟪k:6⟫I gave "
"them my blood, yes.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫My young hands were perpetually covered in wounds. ⟪k:11⟫"
"Running out of skin on my fingers, I cut the back of my hands, my palms, my wrists. ⟪k:12⟫Before "
"long, they had turned into swollen, carved-up, black-and-red horrors, ⟪k:13⟫and so I kept them "
"wrapped in cloth at all times. ⟪k:14⟫The only time I uncovered them was to give blood to those "
"who sought it.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫My lacerated hands were, in no uncertain terms, gruesome and "
"unsightly, ⟪k:18⟫but the believers who came to see me all wept at my “selfless sacrifice.”⟪k:19⟫"
"⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫And so I came to cherish those wounds."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Não demorou muito para que a notícia se espalhasse da filha de Deus realizadora de "
"milagres. ⟪k:2⟫Viajantes de terras distantes vinham à nossa aldeia, todos em busca de ajuda.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Impulsionada por uma mistura de euforia e dever, dei minhas bênçãos a todos os "
"peregrinos que as procuravam. ⟪k:6⟫Eu dei a eles meu sangue, sim.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Minhas mãos "
"jovens estavam perpetuamente cobertas de feridas. ⟪k:11⟫Ficando sem pele em meus dedos, cortei as "
"costas das minhas mãos, minhas palmas, meus pulsos. ⟪k:12⟫Em pouco tempo, elas se transformaram "
"em horrores preto e vermelho, talhadas e inchadas, ⟪k:13⟫e então eu as mantive embrulhadas em "
"pano o tempo todo. ⟪k:14⟫A única vez que as descobria era para dar sangue a quem o procurava."
"⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Minhas mãos dilaceradas eram, em termos inequívocos, horríveis e feias, ⟪k:18⟫"
"mas todos os crentes que vieram me ver derramaram lágrimas ao meu “sacrifício abnegado.”⟪k:19⟫"
"⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫E então, eu vim a valorizar essas feridas."

#: search2:search2_B6BD1699_7737_4379_B796_F6F4888EB0FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5fc9e1b8ff092444f68a1bf7d9e06aa6957e7ed7ea517686c669b6435f24250c
#. default-sha256: 6c1eddf47b6090b6a6aeec3a98aedf981d79c9a03127729abaa8e93fdcde03c4
msgctxt "search2:search2_B6BD1699_7737_4379_B796_F6F4888EB0FD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But the next day, ⟪k:2⟫I was sold off.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Men I had never seen before "
"carried me by the arms and tossed me into a carriage. ⟪k:6⟫Confused and panicked, I stuck my head "
"out, searching for my mother.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Off in the shadow of the house, ⟪k:10⟫I saw her with "
"a strange man—⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫accepting a bag of coins."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mas no dia seguinte, ⟪k:2⟫eu fui vendida.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Homens que eu nunca tinha visto "
"antes me carregaram pelos braços e me jogaram em uma carruagem. ⟪k:6⟫Confusa e em pânico, "
"coloquei minha cabeça para fora, procurando por minha mãe.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Fora, na sombra da casa, "
"⟪k:10⟫eu a vi com um homem estranho—⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫aceitando um saco de moedas."

#: search2:search2_E6FB4A24_7FE8_4101_A9C9_F5A1C933E065
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 281efda412661d587bcafcac2c86066e75ce6d3eba191bd41e3c1854714eeceb
#. default-sha256: a39f86f3347ae43f9c7e0a4cbb4877db22f9ca8d7ddf6315147e559b8a9710ad
msgctxt "search2:search2_E6FB4A24_7FE8_4101_A9C9_F5A1C933E065"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The carriage rocked back and forth, back and forth as it rolled along a dirt road. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Shaking and bouncing within it, I struggled with overwhelming grief and despair. ⟪k:3⟫It was, "
"perhaps, the first time in my life I had felt such a powerful emotion.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I didn’t "
"know ⟪k:7⟫what⟪k:8⟫ I felt so much despair over, though. ⟪k:9⟫Obviously, it was over my present "
"predicament, but I wasn’t sure what about it hurt the most.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Was it that I "
"had been pawned off like a slave? ⟪k:14⟫Was it that my mother—the mother of a saint—had been "
"blinded by money? ⟪k:15⟫Was it that the villagers had watched in silence as a disciple of the "
"Lord was thrown into a carriage?⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Or was it that I, daughter of God, ⟪k:20⟫"
"lamented my misfortune like a mortal?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A carruagem balançava para frente e para trás, para frente e para trás, enquanto rolava "
"por uma estrada de terra. ⟪k:2⟫Tremendo e saltando dentro dela, lutei com uma dor e desespero "
"esmagadores. ⟪k:3⟫Foi, talvez, a primeira vez na minha vida que senti uma emoção tão forte.⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Eu não sabia ⟪k:7⟫pelo que⟪k:8⟫ eu sentia tanto desespero, no entanto. ⟪k:9⟫Obviamente, "
"era por causa da minha situação atual, mas eu não tinha certeza do que mais doía.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Foi por ter sido penhorada como uma escrava? ⟪k:14⟫Foi porque minha mãe—a mãe de uma "
"santa—tinha sido cegada pelo dinheiro? ⟪k:15⟫Foi porque os aldeões assistiram em silêncio "
"enquanto uma discípula do Senhor era jogada em uma carruagem?⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Ou foi por "
"que eu, filha de Deus, ⟪k:20⟫lamentei minha desgraça como uma mortal?"

#: search2:search2_FF2F5CD2_17B0_44F3_8CA1_E7DA2DDDB0FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8627fc8f14bac85674709b3b08d70042644ee5ecac1ebad676faa5f5e293fdb9
#. default-sha256: b923418f9d94bc56c23a549465d0349114ed78954f895c0484e1e35a96545ef1
msgctxt "search2:search2_FF2F5CD2_17B0_44F3_8CA1_E7DA2DDDB0FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The third week, the carriage arrived at a city. ⟪k:1⟫It was much larger than the village I "
"had grown up in, with many, many more people crowding the streets. ⟪k:2⟫Something about them ⟪k:3⟫"
"felt⟪k:4⟫ different too.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫They all spoke in a tongue foreign to me, ⟪k:8⟫which is "
"when I realized I was far, far away from home."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Na terceira semana, a carruagem chegou a uma cidade. ⟪k:1⟫Era muito maior do que a aldeia em "
"que cresci, com muito, muito mais gente lotando as ruas. ⟪k:2⟫Algo sobre eles ⟪k:3⟫parecia⟪k:4⟫ "
"diferente também.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Todos eles falavam em uma língua estranha para mim, ⟪k:8⟫que foi "
"quando percebi que estava muito, muito longe de casa."

#: search2:search2_DC4CD8EC_3727_4CDB_B254_F3D9D4B750B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c3b3589e9cec21d0c9d3965c4d8f5b118bfc18d4d58880dc862191bf8278d80
#. default-sha256: 91ea5d2e3b39200985dda4c2d7d2aa840866c98efaedcf09ecf9cbe81ed51068
msgctxt "search2:search2_DC4CD8EC_3727_4CDB_B254_F3D9D4B750B2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was delivered to the lavishly decorated mansion of the region’s lord. ⟪k:2⟫Brightly "
"colored flowers bloomed wildly in the garden as guests laughed and ate extravagant meals.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫And in addition to them, there were probably four times as many slaves moving about the "
"grounds.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Getting a range of looks from everyone we passed—from smartly dressed men "
"to scrawny, emaciated servants—I was led to the lord’s chambers.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫The lord "
"was surrounded by beautiful women. ⟪k:13⟫Perhaps they were slaves, or perhaps they were "
"prostitutes—I couldn’t tell. ⟪k:14⟫Among them were some girls hardly older than me. ⟪k:15⟫They "
"all wore thin swathes of cloth, barely covering themselves at all.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫The "
"lord looked me up and down, and with a laugh, he said,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Fui entregue à mansão ricamente decorada do lorde da região. ⟪k:2⟫Flores de cores vivas "
"desabrochavam no jardim enquanto os convidados riam e comiam refeições extravagantes.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫E, além deles, havia provavelmente quatro vezes mais escravos se movendo pelo terreno.⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Obtendo uma série de olhares de todos por quem passamos—de homens bem vestidos a servos "
"esqueléticos e emaciados—fui conduzida aos aposentos do lorde.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫O lorde "
"estava rodeado de belas mulheres. ⟪k:13⟫Talvez fossem escravas, ou talvez fossem prostitutas—não "
"sei dizer. ⟪k:14⟫Entre elas estavam algumas meninas pouco mais velhas do que eu. ⟪k:15⟫Todas elas "
"usavam faixas finas de pano, mal cobrindo alguma coisa.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫O lorde me olhou "
"de cima a baixo, e com uma risada, ele disse,"

#: search2:search2_C36F63C9_F725_4400_A3C1_2F80C9ED50DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ef46b0ab56e5ee6e9515b6c30dc2d19bb32309ba5e7a694113655be2fb50db2
#. default-sha256: 0332f90d16ddc0e05eae2caf1b47cab0efba6692158b840e42155382497b5668
msgctxt "search2:search2_C36F63C9_F725_4400_A3C1_2F80C9ED50DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So the lord forced his will upon me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He bound my hands and feet and cut me "
"without my permission, filling a goblet with my blood and passing it around to his guests."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Então o lorde impôs sua vontade sobre mim.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ele amarrou minhas mãos e pés e me "
"cortou sem minha permissão, enchendo uma taça com meu sangue e passando-a para seus convidados."

#: search2:search2_77C89967_DD3E_4BBB_BCE1_E8B26CF824F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06bb06cdbbbfad9a8d0895b7819e3a3a0d43eab4ccf3b0584c20fbce9a8b3608
#. default-sha256: a9e7aeade74296476c20b960862d126ade0bc7360d7ebc7491711d48e96a6a18
msgctxt "search2:search2_77C89967_DD3E_4BBB_BCE1_E8B26CF824F5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Every time he threw a banquet, he drained me of my blood.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It became nearly "
"impossible to find a spot on either of my arms that ⟪k:4⟫wasn’t⟪k:5⟫ a swollen, reddish-black "
"gash. ⟪k:6⟫And soon, because my arms weren’t providing enough blood for him, the cutting spread "
"to my legs.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I lived in a haze of half-consciousness. ⟪k:11⟫Honestly, I’m "
"amazed it didn’t kill me, though perhaps the lord was simply taking care not to take more than my "
"body could spare.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Watching the wealthy partygoers laugh and sip my blood "
"through bleary eyes, another wave of despair came over me. ⟪k:16⟫My miracles—my blood—were not "
"meant to be an appetizer at a feast. They were meant for the sick and the poor.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫"
"But despite my wishes, the lord persisted to squeeze me dry day in and day out for his own "
"enjoyment."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Toda vez que dava um banquete, ele drenava meu sangue.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Tornou-se quase "
"impossível encontrar um ponto em qualquer um dos meus braços que ⟪k:4⟫não fosse⟪k:5⟫ um corte "
"vermelho-escuro inchado. ⟪k:6⟫E logo, porque meus braços não estavam fornecendo sangue suficiente "
"para ele, o corte se espalhou para minhas pernas.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Eu vivi em uma névoa de "
"meia-consciência. ⟪k:11⟫Honestamente, estou surpresa que não tenha me matado, embora talvez o "
"lorde estivesse simplesmente tomando cuidado para não levar mais do que meu corpo poderia "
"dispensar.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Observando os foliões ricos rindo e bebendo meu sangue com "
"olhos turvos, outra onda de desespero tomou conta de mim. ⟪k:16⟫Meus milagres—meu sangue—não "
"foram feitos para serem um aperitivo em um banquete. Eles foram feitos para os doentes e os "
"pobres.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Mas, apesar dos meus desejos, o lorde persistiu em me espremer dia após "
"dia para seu próprio prazer."

#: search2:search2_265BA5DF_1814_4DFB_94E0_36DEC30575C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1210c4994308b2e7afef0477c77611771d3fb282fd3b00b3875c9ef503a07263
#. default-sha256: 4e93927f616be5a26ba049b0dba9b0efc5fce822da9a5904e5a26e2e52488056
msgctxt "search2:search2_265BA5DF_1814_4DFB_94E0_36DEC30575C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Suddenly, I found myself released from my bonds. ⟪k:1⟫But my body had grown so weak from "
"being tied up for so long, I didn’t have the strength to hold myself up—and so I collapsed to the "
"floor.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I was still trying to figure out what was happening when the lord drew "
"a sword, raising it high above his head. ⟪k:6⟫His words in that moment reached me with perfect "
"clarity:"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫De repente, me vi livre de minhas amarras. ⟪k:1⟫Mas meu corpo ficou tão fraco por ter ficado "
"amarrado por tanto tempo que não tive forças para me segurar—e então eu desabei no chão.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Eu ainda estava tentando entender o que estava acontecendo quando o lorde sacou uma "
"espada, erguendo-a alta acima de sua cabeça. ⟪k:6⟫Suas palavras naquele momento me alcançaram com "
"perfeita clareza:"

#: search2:search2_836438AF_6ED4_4876_982D_86366DA1A3A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c61d066b2c694f4497b780440cec2d3967344d99a94461da7aff6ebb5f118f3
#. default-sha256: 2ee4fe07240b0ec3a1e1b30805fad24e352bb69ea233ada60fcd8a053820f9af
msgctxt "search2:search2_836438AF_6ED4_4876_982D_86366DA1A3A5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A witch?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Why was he calling me a witch?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I was the holy "
"daughter of God; ⟪k:8⟫I had certainly never made a pact with the Devil.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫What "
"could have given him that idea? What was in store for me now? Had God performed some kind of "
"miracle for him? ⟪k:12⟫Dozens of thoughts and questions floated through my mind as death hung "
"over me.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫I couldn’t comprehend anything, and so I didn’t feel any fear or "
"anger at my impending death. ⟪k:17⟫I was simply curious:⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫What had happened to me?"
"⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫But before I had a chance to find that answer—⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫the lord "
"swung down his blade."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Uma bruxa?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Por que ele estava me chamando de bruxa?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Eu era "
"a santa filha de Deus; ⟪k:8⟫Certamente nunca tinha feito um pacto com o Diabo.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫O "
"que poderia ter dado a ele essa ideia? O que estava reservado para mim agora? Deus realizou algum "
"tipo de milagre para ele? ⟪k:12⟫Dezenas de pensamentos e perguntas flutuaram em minha mente "
"enquanto a morte pairava sobre mim.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Eu não conseguia compreender nada e, "
"portanto, não sentia nenhum medo ou raiva pela minha morte iminente. ⟪k:17⟫Estava simplesmente "
"curiosa:⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫O que aconteceu comigo?⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫Mas antes que eu tivesse a "
"chance de encontrar essa resposta—⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫o lorde baixou sua lâmina."

#: search2:search2_E9D2BF9F_A6F9_4B5D_8A29_428A3E90DD8C
