msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Right at my ear, I can hear the ⟪k:1⟫hssssssss, ⟪k:2⟫hssssssss...⟪k:3⟫ of the river of blood."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Bem no meu ouvido, eu consigo ouvir o ⟪k:1⟫hssssssss, ⟪k:2⟫hssssssss...⟪k:3⟫ do rio de "
"sangue."

