msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I can practically feel the fire in the eyes of that mad blood banquet’s guests..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu praticamente posso sentir o fogo nos olhos dos convidados daquele louco "
