#: search2:search2_2508DEB6_0794_4D62_80BA_0D3A3B727400
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68bd82ff50b12f4c30a1d49baf32ed36178277e2e85343396e3c2a72f537f044
#. default-sha256: 6224e2cc959ec01623604bbe183adc29bd5401c809006d774576d5c83ad9d020
msgctxt "search2:search2_2508DEB6_0794_4D62_80BA_0D3A3B727400"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After all, I was a ⟪k:1⟫saint⟪k:2⟫, and saints were supposed to retain their purity. ⟪k:3⟫"
"Spreading my legs for any man who gave me enough coins would shatter my very identity.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫As all that was going through my mind, I probably shouted “No!” in protest, ⟪k:7⟫because the "
"slave gave me an exasperated look and told me he hadn’t brought me here to become a prostitute."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Afinal, eu era uma ⟪k:1⟫santa⟪k:2⟫, e os santos deveriam manter sua pureza. ⟪k:3⟫Abrir "
"minhas pernas para qualquer homem que me desse moedas suficientes destruiria minha própria "
"identidade.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Como tudo isso estava passando pela minha cabeça, provavelmente gritei "
"“Não!” em protesto, ⟪k:7⟫porque o escravo me lançou um olhar exasperado e me disse que não tinha "
"me trazido aqui para me tornar uma prostituta."

#: search2:search2_372CD282_492D_4E94_A14F_1CF2576D8010
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e693b79271052aeafee452f65c910a0b15b155c3a04d8720fcbcb41e1a2783d1
#. default-sha256: eb8af039ab4db670d078b52de584602c8281727f4befe55f79e5274dbdff9455
msgctxt "search2:search2_372CD282_492D_4E94_A14F_1CF2576D8010"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I despised life at the brothel.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The men who came to buy their services "
"were disgusting buffoons—the kind of people who would think they could deceive God. ⟪k:5⟫And the "
"women fawning over them were just as repulsive.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫That said, I had nowhere else to "
"go, ⟪k:9⟫which meant I was forced to suffer that sickening place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eu desprezava a vida no bordel.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Os homens que vinham comprar seus "
"serviços eram palhaços repugnantes—o tipo de pessoa que pensaria que poderia enganar a Deus. ⟪k:5⟫"
"E as mulheres bajulando-os eram tão repulsivas quanto.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Dito isso, eu não tinha "
"outro lugar para ir, ⟪k:9⟫o que significava que fui forçada a sofrer aquele lugar repugnante."

#: search2:search2_4DED1AF3_6BFA_4E24_AF85_57D0F1A62035
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c903eab99551268788ff933cbb4c862cbc1664fc36d1c7e4d096f17272a9c0ce
#. default-sha256: 8117a8b1fb9e9634f97bf667e398ab162a4a5592d0329cb6474f4a7259145228
msgctxt "search2:search2_4DED1AF3_6BFA_4E24_AF85_57D0F1A62035"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But by the time a year or so had passed... ⟪k:2⟫my feelings about it had changed.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The women of the brothel took good care of me, treating me like a sister. ⟪k:6⟫At "
"first, it was just irritating—I was a ⟪k:7⟫saint⟪k:8⟫, and how could a saint have prostitutes for "
"sisters? ⟪k:9⟫But over time, I got to know them better—grew to appreciate their circumstances and "
"hardships.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Despite barely having enough money to keep food on the table, "
"whenever they had a little to spare, they would use it to purchase medicine. ⟪k:14⟫Ointments to "
"apply to my arms, legs, and face. ⟪k:15⟫And as a result of their generosity, my arms and legs "
"started looking almost human—but nothing had any effect on my face."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mas quando um ano ou mais se passou... ⟪k:2⟫meus sentimentos sobre ele mudaram.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫As mulheres do bordel cuidaram bem de mim, me trataram como uma irmã. ⟪k:6⟫No começo, "
"foi apenas irritante—eu era uma ⟪k:7⟫santa⟪k:8⟫, e como uma santa poderia ter prostitutas como "
"irmãs? ⟪k:9⟫Mas com o tempo, eu as conheci melhor—passei a apreciar suas circunstâncias e "
"dificuldades.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Apesar de mal ter dinheiro para manter comida na mesa, "
"sempre que sobrava um pouco, usavam para comprar remédios. ⟪k:14⟫Pomadas para aplicar em meus "
"braços, pernas e rosto. ⟪k:15⟫E como resultado de sua generosidade, meus braços e pernas "
"começaram a parecer quase humanos—mas nada teve algum efeito em meu rosto."

#: search2:search2_49868C07_5C7F_4310_8998_67F1CCED4A33
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3929ac0005bbe643a6c01ed206a60cfc58d89818ba83a8303cb653fd27948534
#. default-sha256: a7a766e9fb87996839a44c637e3bfc8c679eca1c1530f6fe384ecf42841e32f8
msgctxt "search2:search2_49868C07_5C7F_4310_8998_67F1CCED4A33"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My time at the brothel was probably, all things considered, one of the brighter "
"chapters of my life. ⟪k:2⟫There, I was neither saint nor witch, but an ordinary human girl. ⟪k:3⟫"
"For the first time, I felt like my life had meaning beyond my assumed “divine purpose”; I was "
"even beginning to feel kind of happy.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫And with each passing day, my intractable "
"worldview was gaining a little flexibility."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Meu tempo no bordel foi provavelmente, considerando tudo, um dos capítulos mais "
"brilhantes da minha vida. ⟪k:2⟫Lá, eu não era santa nem bruxa, mas uma garota humana comum. ⟪k:3⟫"
"Pela primeira vez, senti que minha vida tinha um significado além do meu suposto “propósito "
"divino”; Eu estava até começando a me sentir meio feliz.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫E a cada dia que passava, "
"minha intratável visão de mundo ganhava um pouco de flexibilidade."

#: search2:search2_7C67598C_FBF3_41D9_9824_3D3554D47F21
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3edef72df0bad67030580508e19b27eca7db563011a989e97e5e896079f73cbf
#. default-sha256: d4c2ee7aeb39ee90aa25b0d521adcfb8395567772cf44a7b189ddea8dd0d1cdc
msgctxt "search2:search2_7C67598C_FBF3_41D9_9824_3D3554D47F21"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But for some reason...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫For some reason, happiness always seems to slip "
"away as soon as you’ve got your hands around it. ⟪k:5⟫No one sincerely ⟪k:6⟫wants⟪k:7⟫ to lose "
"it, so why must they?⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I certainly didn’t mind not being miserable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mas por algum motivo...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Por alguma razão, a felicidade sempre parece "
"desaparecer assim que você a segura. ⟪k:5⟫Ninguém sinceramente ⟪k:6⟫quer⟪k:7⟫ perdê-la, então por "
"que eles deveriam?⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Eu certamente não me importava de não ser miserável."

#: search2:search2_0E96566D_520E_4A59_8C90_C49A7098D6B5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 45a7826949bd9c1b8f7bf1bbd2719757db5dbd0c627bb5d45767efc5c9009afc
#. default-sha256: 0f38ef1eaee27e79cfeb6a33c1d5a72d51b5feeed798ea9d1891d35a3200ed34
msgctxt "search2:search2_0E96566D_520E_4A59_8C90_C49A7098D6B5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The carriage was packed so tight you could barely see the floor—and it smelled like "
"death. ⟪k:2⟫Sweat, urine, feces—every foul odor imaginable compressed into a tiny space.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫There were both men and women there, nearly all of them muttering or groaning or weeping."
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Everyone was young, ripe to be put to work."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A carruagem estava tão apertada que mal dava para ver o chão—e cheirava a morte. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Suor, urina, fezes—todo odor desagradável imaginável comprimido em um espaço minúsculo.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫Havia homens e mulheres lá, quase todos resmungando, gemendo ou chorando.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Todo "
"mundo era jovem, maduro para ser colocado para trabalhar."

#: search2:search2_BEA891AE_D9B6_4C23_B721_07C3F608C144
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca104718a4540b084bab452c133a41866c5652e25f867a9268816f3f128bbd64
#. default-sha256: 5ea974e9c4a95460f8a8460bccb3296037c3b5163e72f8096b0a74d4c0084f74
msgctxt "search2:search2_BEA891AE_D9B6_4C23_B721_07C3F608C144"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It didn’t take me long to realize what fate awaited these people—and me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And "
"when I did, I just sat there in silence.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Then, for the first time, I cried.⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I was experiencing, I believe, a very human emotion. ⟪k:10⟫I was sad. ⟪k:11⟫Hurt that I "
"had been taken away from a place where I was happy. ⟪k:12⟫From the women at the brothel—and that "
"young man. ⟪k:13⟫It crushed me.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫And no longer did I wonder why such a "
"thing was happening to “the holy daughter of God.”⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Something about my "
"tears must have seemed strange to him, because one man saw me and said,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não demorei muito para perceber que destino aguardava essas pessoas—e eu.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫E "
"quando o fiz, apenas sentei lá em silêncio.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Então, pela primeira vez, eu chorei."
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Eu estava experimentando, acredito, uma emoção bem humana. ⟪k:10⟫Estava triste. "
"⟪k:11⟫Magoada por ter sido tirada de um lugar onde era feliz. ⟪k:12⟫Das mulheres do bordel—e "
"daquele jovem. ⟪k:13⟫Isso me destruiu.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫E já não me perguntava por que tal "
"coisa estava acontecendo com “a santa filha de Deus.”⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Algo sobre minhas "
"lágrimas deve ter parecido estranho para ele, porque um homem me viu e disse,"

#: search2:search2_67093575_F906_4D09_AA64_8794D0C8082F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b990a4c50fdebdbc497cfaf03528b53f403ad63b61e5168f2c81c996170e20c
#. default-sha256: a164fe071a0cc1fbba28d8d68fb4d5196f3c9a9d0da773defbc285e4c8962dad
msgctxt "search2:search2_67093575_F906_4D09_AA64_8794D0C8082F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫He was a curious man. ⟪k:2⟫To start, he looked very different from anyone else. ⟪k:3⟫"
"The color of his skin. The length of his nose. The shape of his eyes. ⟪k:4⟫Everything about him "
"was new and unusual.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Hesitantly, I replied,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ele era um homem curioso. ⟪k:2⟫Para começar, ele parecia muito diferente de qualquer "
"outro. ⟪k:3⟫A cor de sua pele. O comprimento de seu nariz. A forma de seus olhos. ⟪k:4⟫Tudo sobre "
"ele era novo e incomum.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Hesitante, respondi,"

#: search2:search2_F016AF4F_74FC_4380_A01F_A7586C0A1EBC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91f411bc299f50c2fedd943b43284b79df82fcce62a1ee809a4b52c2e472141b
#. default-sha256: f97a69d8417db2fe2f3869217c989680d8e88576df26beaa5b3f507aa512b3d9
msgctxt "search2:search2_F016AF4F_74FC_4380_A01F_A7586C0A1EBC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The man fell silent, looking as though he was deep in thought. ⟪k:2⟫I had no idea why "
"he had asked me that, but something about him made me uncomfortable, so I couldn’t bring myself "
"to ask.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Several hours later, the man suddenly stood up. ⟪k:7⟫The guards had no "
"patience for anyone stepping out of line, and they didn’t look like they would hesitate to kill "
"us either. ⟪k:8⟫So, unsurprisingly, one at the back of the carriage drew his sword and pointed it "
"at the man.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫What ⟪k:12⟫was⟪k:13⟫ surprising, though, was what happened next. "
"⟪k:14⟫The man—his hands shackled like the rest of us—leapt for the guard, slamming his fists into "
"his face and stealing his sword."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫O homem ficou em silêncio, parecendo estar imerso em pensamentos. ⟪k:2⟫Eu não tinha "
"ideia de por que ele havia me perguntado isso, mas algo sobre ele me deixou desconfortável, então "
"não consegui perguntar.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Várias horas depois, o homem de repente se levantou. "
"⟪k:7⟫Os guardas não tinham paciência para ninguém que saisse da linha e também não pareciam que "
"hesitariam em nos matar. ⟪k:8⟫Então, sem surpresa, um na parte de trás da carruagem sacou sua "
"espada e apontou para o homem.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫O que ⟪k:12⟫foi⟪k:13⟫ surpreendente, porém, foi o "
"que aconteceu a seguir. ⟪k:14⟫O homem—com as mãos algemadas como o resto de nós—saltou para o "
"guarda, batendo com os punhos no rosto dele e roubando sua espada."

#: search2:search2_3C6B1FA8_F8E3_439D_AAA6_9EE22F657EA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 933b853c9c4e3e6007f23494799c417a336d60a8bcc58c3400c1fed42ecac9bc
#. default-sha256: 7e141771db743ef6a96f25eea7d26d70d631a8a9956553cdbe764ac6d7995093
msgctxt "search2:search2_3C6B1FA8_F8E3_439D_AAA6_9EE22F657EA5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The entire carriage was in shock. ⟪k:2⟫The guards were too stunned to effectively "
"react, so they were quickly cut down. ⟪k:3⟫And because the one-man uprising had taken place "
"between cities, there was no one the slave traders could ask for help before they were "
"slaughtered.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫In the blink of an eye, it was all over.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫And there was "
"nothing “human” about what I had witnessed. ⟪k:10⟫If I had to describe it, I would say it was as "
"though a wild beast had attacked.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫The man ruffled through the slave "
"traders’ clothes until he found the keys, which he brought to me, ordering I unshackle him. ⟪k:15⟫"
"And so I did as he commanded.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Once they had had enough time to process what had "
"happened, the would-be slaves applauded. ⟪k:19⟫Their wretched souls had been saved.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫"
"⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫And for a moment, I believed so too."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A carruagem inteira estava em estado de choque. ⟪k:2⟫Os guardas estavam atordoados "
"demais para reagir efetivamente, então foram rapidamente abatidos. ⟪k:3⟫E como o levante de um "
"homem só ocorreu entre as cidades, não havia ninguém a quem os traficantes de escravos pudessem "
"pedir ajuda antes de serem massacrados.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Num piscar de olhos, tudo acabou.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫E não havia nada de “humano” no que eu havia testemunhado. ⟪k:10⟫ Se eu tivesse que "
"descrever, diria que foi como se uma fera tivesse atacado.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫O homem revirou "
"as roupas dos traficantes de escravos até encontrar as chaves, que ele trouxe para mim, ordenando "
"que eu o soltasse. ⟪k:15⟫E assim o fiz, como ele ordenou.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Assim que tiveram "
"tempo suficiente para processar o que havia acontecido, os aspirantes a escravos aplaudiram. "
"⟪k:19⟫Suas almas miseráveis foram salvas.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫E por um momento, eu também "
"acreditei."

#: search2:search2_CE646FAE_59F9_4D8C_A4C3_260A04AA21CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a7e7d1a5e87f2c1232a7e11d69798f3cbfe17b7b46790459841ca3c282a020e
#. default-sha256: db0b1e06ef33fe22bd8069549ae912de6da16cfaa1944ca345719544928d1981
msgctxt "search2:search2_CE646FAE_59F9_4D8C_A4C3_260A04AA21CF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫When the man’s hands were free, he rolled his shoulders a couple times, made sure "
"everything was in place, ⟪k:2⟫and then, ⟪k:3⟫he began his massacre.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Screams of "
"agony filled the carriage as he ran his sword through the helpless men and women packed inside "
"it. ⟪k:7⟫Blood and guts were splattered against every surface. ⟪k:8⟫And those who tried to escape "
"did not get far before being mercilessly skewered.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫It was like a scene out of a "
"nightmare.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫I was frozen in place. ⟪k:16⟫Not out of fear, but because my "
"mind had shut down. ⟪k:17⟫I couldn’t make sense of what was happening, so my mind rejected it. "
"⟪k:18⟫And with my brain having given up, my body was no more than a lifeless puppet."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Quando as mãos do homem estavam livres, ele revirou os ombros algumas vezes, certificou-"
"se de que tudo estava no lugar, ⟪k:2⟫e então, ⟪k:3⟫ele começou seu massacre.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Gritos "
"de agonia encheram a carruagem enquanto ele passava sua espada pelos homens e mulheres indefesos "
"amontoados dentro dela. ⟪k:7⟫Sangue e vísceras foram espalhados contra cada superfície. ⟪k:8⟫E "
"quem tentou fugir não foi longe antes de ser impiedosamente empalado.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Foi como "
"uma cena de um pesadelo.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Eu estava congelada no lugar. ⟪k:16⟫Não por medo, "
"mas porque minha mente estava desligada. ⟪k:17⟫ Eu não conseguia entender o que estava "
"acontecendo, então minha mente rejeitou. ⟪k:18⟫E com meu cérebro tendo desistido, meu corpo não "
"era mais do que uma marionete sem vida."

#: search2:search2_ED75D9A8_09AE_49FE_AB90_631A4242816B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 021534e37b881317110f84854c73870faafec983eb82bb02bac27918806c6267
#. default-sha256: 4157f1a4667b1a33f8c2d13ff04206d3c585c000f58246bb47b423764d394eda
msgctxt "search2:search2_ED75D9A8_09AE_49FE_AB90_631A4242816B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫In short order, all the slaves were dead, and I was sitting in a "
"pool of blood staring at the man. ⟪k:6⟫He pointed his blade at me, and with a little smirk, said, "
"“Why didn’t you run?”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫In turn, I asked him, “Why did you kill them?”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫The smile vanished from his face, and after a few quiet moments of pondering, he replied, "
"“Because I felt like it.”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“And why haven’t you killed me yet?” I asked.⟪k:16⟫"
"⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫To which he gave a curt, “I don’t know,” then withdrew his blade and wandered off "
"into the distance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Em pouco tempo, todos os escravos estavam mortos e eu estava "
"sentada em uma poça de sangue, olhando para o homem. ⟪k:6⟫Ele apontou sua lâmina para mim e, com "
"um pequeno sorriso, disse, “Por que você não correu?”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Por sua vez, perguntei a ele, "
"“Por que você os matou?”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫O sorriso desapareceu de seu rosto e, após alguns "
"momentos de reflexão, ele respondeu, “Porque me deu vontade.”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“E por que você "
"não me matou ainda?” perguntei.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Ao que ele deu um curto, “Eu não sei”, então "
"recolheu sua lâmina e vagou para longe."

#: search2:search2_13C77CCE_7DA7_49D6_A5BF_DAB7BFD1E9CB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 053733c9e552b0885d12b59323700575efe45e19b97c58cc6e0ad5f60e9d41be
#. default-sha256: c883cb902ca441f06bd71bed86d94ebb3f6c5044860ab179dd4eb0eb85a89449
msgctxt "search2:search2_13C77CCE_7DA7_49D6_A5BF_DAB7BFD1E9CB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And then I was all alone, surrounded by corpses.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I glanced down, ⟪k:5⟫and "
"half of someone’s face was looking back up at me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E então eu estava sozinha, cercada por cadáveres.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Olhei para baixo, ⟪k:5⟫"
"e metade do rosto de alguém estava olhando para mim."

#: search2:search2_3DEB4A48_EF59_4C2B_8BFC_3302FFFE69E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
