#: search2:search2_6999942E_AAE4_4D7C_909A_3E4F7AAA4F20
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2281c10199d9e7cc9b05618a1e04dc9e59875eece0f01a86a2e6b18842e93e6
#. default-sha256: c5e47db4c52cabddc17d9458a300d5eb9530dfd79521b692c6bbedf8873ef8d8
msgctxt "search2:search2_6999942E_AAE4_4D7C_909A_3E4F7AAA4F20"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was at a complete loss for some time after that.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I didn’t want to "
"return to the city, because I knew there was no one left who would take me in. ⟪k:5⟫There was "
"only the lord, who had bound me and drained me of my blood.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫So I wandered the "
"roads, no destination in mind and nothing to defend myself but the clothes on my back. ⟪k:9⟫"
"Frankly, I’m rather surprised I wasn’t attacked by bandits.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫After walking "
"for days without food or water, my mind was hazy and my exhaustion at a peak.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫In "
"the distance, I saw a lake. ⟪k:17⟫So driven by my thirst, I turned my unsteady feet toward the "
"water—not caring that it took me off the main road.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫And it turned out that "
"was the correct choice, because there was a small cottage beside the lake, ⟪k:22⟫smoke rising "
"from the chimney, telling me it wasn’t abandoned. ⟪k:23⟫Out of sheer desperation, I knocked on "
"the door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eu estava completamente perdida por algum tempo depois disso.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Eu não "
"queria voltar para a cidade, porque sabia que não havia mais ninguém que me acolhesse. ⟪k:5⟫Havia "
"apenas o lorde, que havia me amarrado e drenado meu sangue.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Então eu vaguei pelas "
"estradas, sem destino em mente e nada para me defender a não ser as roupas do corpo. ⟪k:9⟫"
"Francamente, estou bastante surpresa por não ter sido atacada por bandidos.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫Depois de caminhar por dias sem comida ou água, minha mente estava nebulosa e minha "
"exaustão estava no auge.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Ao longe, vi um lago. ⟪k:17⟫Assim, impulsionada pela "
"minha sede, virei meus pés instáveis em direção à água—sem me importar que isso me tirasse da "
"estrada principal.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫E acabou que foi a escolha certa, porque havia uma "
"pequena cabana ao lado do lago, ⟪k:22⟫fumaça saindo da chaminé, me dizendo que não estava "
"abandonada. ⟪k:23⟫Por puro desespero, bati na porta."

#: search2:search2_661AD98A_B868_45A4_9294_8391281B9EE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 51c0a83b3b97b6c0b665422cd76f428abe8b5694cb7ccc2c0f1fae377b299da3
#. default-sha256: 6c37168e4ddca8d3ec4ea9974c7ee155da4b305dc8cf2b324a80a77e89d0c37d
msgctxt "search2:search2_661AD98A_B868_45A4_9294_8391281B9EE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No one answered.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The door wasn’t locked, so I slowly, hesitantly pushed "
"it open.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫And beyond it, I found an old woman, sitting dead in a chair."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ninguém respondeu.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫A porta não estava trancada, então eu lenta e "
"hesitantemente a abri.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫E além dela, encontrei uma velha, sentada morta em uma "
"cadeira."

#: search2:search2_8C228291_98E0_45C7_9088_92594B70465F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2a9eb52b364a73b5d82f9ed5a05c6cfbb5e5b2a7db8975e6ad37f206c5942b2
#. default-sha256: fdc7c59958e10af09344dcba21b5c5d66449f7f4e5e7f06626d508b1b145608b
msgctxt "search2:search2_8C228291_98E0_45C7_9088_92594B70465F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Dragging the woman’s body by her feet, I dumped her into the lake.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Do you "
"think doing so makes me a bad person—makes me unsaintly?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Well, I didn’t have "
"anywhere else to go, and the owner of the cozy cottage was no longer of this world. ⟪k:8⟫There "
"was no reason I couldn’t fill the home in her stead, was there?⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫I deserved to "
"have somewhere I felt comfortable, after everything I’d been through, didn’t I?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫And so, I took up residence in the old witch’s cottage—⟪k:16⟫and remained there until my "
"sixteenth year."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Arrastando o corpo da mulher pelos pés, joguei-a no lago.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Você acha que "
"fazer isso me torna uma pessoa má—me torna uma pessoa não santa?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Bem, eu não tinha "
"para onde ir, e a dona da casinha aconchegante não era mais deste mundo. ⟪k:8⟫Não havia nenhuma "
"razão para que eu não pudesse ocupar a casa em seu lugar, havia?⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Eu merecia ter "
"um lugar onde me sentisse confortável, depois de tudo que passei, não é?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫E "
"assim, passei a residir na cabana da velha bruxa—⟪k:16⟫e lá permaneci até meus dezesseis anos."

#: search2:search2_5E78B70B_A44C_4368_A4F1_02CCFAA545DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e16efb8a21e8be5de5e49070c80129fdcc252dbca490aafdfe7f98ea35e8711e
#. default-sha256: ea2d7e6f745e9041bd4af3e615d2ee09a7291e215dea2e8e0e62c9d5b8fb8e3d
msgctxt "search2:search2_5E78B70B_A44C_4368_A4F1_02CCFAA545DC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫By sixteen, a terrible cynicism had taken root in my heart. ⟪k:2⟫I had no trust for "
"people. ⟪k:3⟫I shut them out, building high walls around myself. ⟪k:4⟫After such a tumultuous, "
"bloody childhood, it was all I could do to protect myself—to keep my young spirit from cracking."
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Nevertheless, travelers would, on occasion, pay the old witch’s cottage a visit, "
"seeking her medicines. ⟪k:8⟫Whenever someone arrived,⟪k:9⟫I would cautiously crack the door open, "
"telling them they could trade for whatever they wanted with food, and never showing my face.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫One day, a young man showed up at the cottage."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Aos dezesseis, um terrível cinismo se enraizou em meu coração. ⟪k:2⟫Eu não tinha "
"confiança nas pessoas. ⟪k:3⟫As barrei, construindo altos muros ao meu redor. ⟪k:4⟫Depois de uma "
"infância tão tumultuada e sangrenta, tudo o que pude fazer foi me proteger—impedir que meu "
"espírito jovem se quebrasse.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫No entanto, os viajantes ocasionalmente visitavam a "
"cabana da velha bruxa, em busca de seus remédios. ⟪k:8⟫Sempre que alguém chegava,⟪k:9⟫eu abria a "
"porta com cuidado, dizendo que eles podiam trocar por qualquer comida que quisessem, e nunca "
"mostrava meu rosto.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Um dia, um jovem apareceu na cabana."

#: search2:search2_721E3BCC_9985_4E7D_8264_852559F930F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22d907222f02f458acab8007c36d4cdebaf11055b94fbb156a683303ace353a6
#. default-sha256: 810e824dc6c41ffba5db7e99b322d42571cbd5b5c614208ecd9db207534a5237
msgctxt "search2:search2_721E3BCC_9985_4E7D_8264_852559F930F9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫He was very soft-spoken—⟪k:2⟫there was a distinct kindness in his voice, which I "
"thought unusual. Curious. ⟪k:3⟫What kind of person could he be? ⟪k:4⟫What did he look like? What "
"expressions did he make as he spoke?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫To satisfy that curiosity, I snuck a peek at "
"him through the crack in the door.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫He was a handsome young man with flowing "
"flaxen hair. ⟪k:12⟫And upon seeing me, he didn’t flinch back in disgust. ⟪k:13⟫He smiled."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ele falava muito suavemente—⟪k:2⟫havia uma gentileza distinta em sua voz, que eu achei "
"incomum. Curiosa. ⟪k:3⟫Como ele era? Que expressões ele fez enquanto falava?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Para "
"satisfazer essa curiosidade, dei uma espiada nele pela fresta da porta.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Ele "
"era um jovem bonito com cabelos linho esvoaçantes. ⟪k:11⟫E ao me ver, não recuou em desgosto. "
"⟪k:12⟫Ele sorriu."

#: search2:search2_8E634A16_A4BE_4A9B_8AB1_60C8630CE626
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b677b659a96c176eac4a38327c538aa8d38bc6e963b3661249e3b92a8b14e5f6
#. default-sha256: 92c791f3fcf6f0d7736e2f781fad4d7c5482020700313d00fcf61b181bfb25fa
msgctxt "search2:search2_8E634A16_A4BE_4A9B_8AB1_60C8630CE626"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That word, muttered beneath his breath, sparked my memory.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I was a saint."
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫My blood had healing properties.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I had no reason to hesitate.⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Someone needed my help, and who deserved it more than this kindhearted young man’s "
"sister?⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫So I decided to tell him what I really was. ⟪k:17⟫That my blood had "
"miraculous powers—that it had saved people. ⟪k:18⟫That the moment I had been born, the drought "
"plaguing my village had come to an end. ⟪k:19⟫That I had been known as a saint—the daughter of "
"God.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫I told him everything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Essa palavra, murmurada em um suspiro, despertou minha memória.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Eu era "
"uma santa.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Meu sangue tinha propriedades curativas.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Eu não tinha "
"motivos para hesitar.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Alguém precisava da minha ajuda, e quem merecia mais do "
"que a irmã desse jovem de bom coração?⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Então decidi contar a ele o que eu "
"realmente era. ⟪k:17⟫Que meu sangue tinha poderes milagrosos—que ele tinha salvado pessoas. ⟪k:18⟫"
"Que no momento em que nasci, a seca que assolava minha aldeia havia chegado ao fim. ⟪k:19⟫Que eu "
"era conhecida como uma santa—a filha de Deus.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫Contei tudo a ele."

#: search2:search2_4C2F47EA_0EB8_438B_BEA0_C0B0D2250A74
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 060ff2de3171067664e7de74f00ae2ce156e8859c149e79f2fea16b538f69d63
#. default-sha256: 99999b0fa7cf32850c0c772f9f273b12373ff283583a771d98dc2f39c51d1b2b
msgctxt "search2:search2_4C2F47EA_0EB8_438B_BEA0_C0B0D2250A74"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Neither of them had any doubts about my sainthood. ⟪k:2⟫And because they believed, a "
"miracle occurred.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The flaxen-haired girl recovered enough to get out of her bed."
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I was extremely proud of myself. ⟪k:9⟫I felt like, for once, I had ⟪k:10⟫"
"actually⟪k:11⟫ saved someone’s life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nenhum deles tinha dúvidas sobre a minha santidade. ⟪k:2⟫E porque eles acreditaram, um "
"milagre aconteceu.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫A garota de cabelos linho se recuperou o suficiente para sair da "
"cama.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Eu estava extremamente orgulhosa de mim mesma. ⟪k:9⟫Senti que, pela primeira "
"vez, ⟪k:10⟫realmente⟪k:11⟫ salvei a vida de alguém."

#: search2:search2_C9949666_80B0_4738_8347_37314F7B3142
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e76fbacbb49a7af8657aa394c57a25ac069d88b4c264fd32c025e35be460af65
#. default-sha256: 746f183c549b98e30eda94027a162642dcb9f70c66ea6bd6de900f62df93403a
msgctxt "search2:search2_C9949666_80B0_4738_8347_37314F7B3142"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The only issue was... she didn’t make a ⟪k:2⟫complete⟪k:3⟫ recovery. ⟪k:4⟫For a few "
"days after drinking my blood, she was in good health, but her condition quickly regressed.⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I was deeply perplexed by this. ⟪k:8⟫A miracle ⟪k:9⟫had⟪k:10⟫ undoubtedly taken place, "
"but it was only temporary.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Now, though, I believe I can explain what happened."
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Her “recovery” was nothing more than a placebo effect caused by her faith."
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫But that’s something I couldn’t have known at the time. ⟪k:22⟫We were all "
"three perplexed—and we were all three disheartened."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫O único problema foi... ela não teve uma recuperação ⟪k:2⟫completa⟪k:3⟫. ⟪k:4⟫Por "
"alguns dias depois de beber meu sangue, ela estava com boa saúde, mas sua condição regrediu "
"rapidamente.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Fiquei profundamente perplexa com isso. ⟪k:8⟫Um milagre ⟪k:9⟫"
"havia⟪k:10⟫ sem dúvida ocorrido, mas foi apenas temporário.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Agora, porém, "
"acredito que posso explicar o que aconteceu.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Sua “recuperação” nada mais "
"foi do que um efeito placebo causado por sua fé.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Mas isso é algo que eu "
"não poderia saber na época. ⟪k:22⟫Estávamos todos os três perplexos—e estávamos todos os três "
"desanimados."

#: search2:search2_9EC83FDB_B6F9_451B_87F3_19C5CE993A91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 03c27070277156933e8161095605a97a1c8e2f2f3bf8251a2dacb43e781cd5ea
#. default-sha256: 5dd5d1567225b923f1f47adc1ada67f3d5962c94155ca0a4364a050a9ee3b032
msgctxt "search2:search2_9EC83FDB_B6F9_451B_87F3_19C5CE993A91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I told the man he had to leave. ⟪k:2⟫That I would not be opening the door for any "
"reason.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫In response, he said,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eu disse ao homem que ele tinha que ir embora. ⟪k:2⟫Que eu não abriria a porta pelo "
"motivo que fosse.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Em resposta, ele disse,"

#: search2:search2_D971AEF5_2313_4E85_8E48_D798F1DF075A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7eeac59ffde0b5bc38327f95520f6ac318e967421ea137177bdfb269188b6a1
#. default-sha256: 4ebafc7365790cf06ab9afc462527c511792f5e3be0ff21338c29d4a9f9bb1ed
msgctxt "search2:search2_D971AEF5_2313_4E85_8E48_D798F1DF075A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“I am in need of your blood.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Could you not spare a little?”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Estou precisando do seu sangue.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Você não poderia distribuir um pouco?”"

#: search2:search2_45DC4392_FB6D_43F6_8000_72DDF77FF12B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d557d9e50c794815cacfdb7b881d29135b405d0bcb9809978823b4934fd3da8
#. default-sha256: 38be8b6e104b093b082961b22e5d679124606ead14009dfa4c9949a23ca1bd89
msgctxt "search2:search2_45DC4392_FB6D_43F6_8000_72DDF77FF12B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“I want to talk to you too...”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Quero falar com você também...”"

#: search2:search2_6E9F9618_223E_4670_B313_8AA7D8EDC3DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82f8765da337188881cf5f362c942a5cd7edc548a2cafc1b2e532e79d2f9c33a
#. default-sha256: c287eaaccf680d93c06cdd95da154ea71b584f7e41651a4b2cb6b0db890be45d
msgctxt "search2:search2_6E9F9618_223E_4670_B313_8AA7D8EDC3DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I was in a daze.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I couldn’t make sense of anything."
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫I didn’t ⟪k:13⟫want⟪k:14⟫ to."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Estava em um torpor.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Não conseguia entender nada.⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Eu não ⟪k:13⟫queria⟪k:14⟫."

#: search2:search2_153578CF_F806_40F0_8C8F_4304193CEE91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5efe0a4910dd69c17a01fdb475ab19a0c4e4dee5dd5af75b52d64c1dc1c06eeb
#. default-sha256: 6393c5ae51a9936fa732f901bc6eccb1cccb341502b4d497d29856a0e89f054a
msgctxt "search2:search2_153578CF_F806_40F0_8C8F_4304193CEE91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My left arm fell to the floor before I even knew what was happening, and then my legs "
"gave out.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The pain, searing and unbearable, came a few moments later, as I was "
"lying in an ever-expanding pool of my own blood.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I did something then that I hadn’t "
"done before—⟪k:8⟫that I had resisted doing no matter how much blood the lord had stolen from me."
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫I screamed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Meu braço esquerdo caiu no chão antes mesmo que soubesse o que estava acontecendo, e "
"então minhas pernas cederam.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫A dor, lancinante e insuportável, veio alguns momentos "
"depois, quando eu estava deitada em uma poça cada vez maior de meu próprio sangue.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"Fiz algo então que não tinha feito antes—⟪k:8⟫que resisti a fazer, não importava quanto sangue o "
"lorde tivesse roubado de mim.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Eu gritei."

#: search2:search2_2AA368F9_ADDD_4DE1_92BF_83577652A094
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14d0c4d14269e5719e7c1d4d3c15b9c00ae9130b37ad969dbbe1fabe2bced418
#. default-sha256: e2ab9b6fe2b8ac1573e2bbb9f2cda453f5bb5af4e3b202a80bfeb8bdd662a63c
msgctxt "search2:search2_2AA368F9_ADDD_4DE1_92BF_83577652A094"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“That’s your share. Should last you long enough.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Essa é a sua parte. Deve durar tempo suficiente.”"

#: search2:search2_C8BAAB1A_B0E2_4471_90E5_47E40ADA5C5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f81ccb818f0d197832494153db278e106e205c8c250aae816454a9494349e7b
#. default-sha256: 3216c7b8f1afbab88a03bc20a6198fd4320d3a57cc9773561faba70b87b98bee
msgctxt "search2:search2_C8BAAB1A_B0E2_4471_90E5_47E40ADA5C5F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Don’t take it personally?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Tell me, is there ⟪k:7⟫anyone⟪k:8⟫ in "
"this world who ⟪k:9⟫wouldn’t⟪k:10⟫ feel a bit of spite after being put through such torture?⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫How was I supposed to let that slide?⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫No one’s ⟪k:17⟫that⟪k:18⟫ much "
"of a saint.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫My trust had been betrayed, and I was supposed to turn the other "
"cheek?⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫A man had barged into my home uninvited and cut off my arm, and I was "
"supposed to smile and take it?⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫Is there anyone, anywhere, who doesn’t feel even "
"the slightest bit of hatred ever?⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫Is there anyone in this world who could just "
"laugh and brush off this level of abuse?⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫Tell me, is there?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Não levar para o pessoal?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Diga-me, existe ⟪k:7⟫alguém⟪k:8⟫ "
"neste mundo que ⟪k:9⟫não⟪k:10⟫ sentiria um pouco de rancor depois de passar por tal tortura?⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Como eu deveria deixar isso para lá?⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Ninguém é ⟪k:17⟫tão⟪k:18⟫ santo."
"⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Minha confiança foi traída, e eu deveria dar a outra face?⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫Um "
"homem invadiu minha casa sem ser convidado e cortou meu braço, e eu deveria sorrir e aceitar?"
"⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫Existe alguém, em qualquer lugar, que nunca sinta nem um pouco de ódio?⟪k:28⟫"
"⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫Existe alguém neste mundo que poderia simplesmente rir e ignorar esse nível de abuso?"
"⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫Diga-me, existe?"

#: search2:search2_7994CF70_8B72_470E_ADB2_7A32EAF74B34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d939d7f343ce0c950e9fd440f3095ba0b78a5129e972bc756cffafac72d43e6
#. default-sha256: 927f44cfdf343dfa4f78d3f55b21e6bcdd4572096561578358bbc09e98081f3d
msgctxt "search2:search2_7994CF70_8B72_470E_ADB2_7A32EAF74B34"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“So the lord made me an offer:”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Então o lorde me fez uma oferta:”"

#: search2:search2_882D7805_A53B_4B83_B0E8_DEB128D83AD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 538631d7ad539799e2abfbea90c4ccf87501f29cc3c5875a219e7d81e3ae8ba1
#. default-sha256: 781807792041e24af1a50fd92a7e592a6663d243268117055426cf0877746bfe
msgctxt "search2:search2_882D7805_A53B_4B83_B0E8_DEB128D83AD6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The lord?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Why him again?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Why couldn’t he leave me alone?"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫After trying to kill me during one of his blood sabbats, why was he after my "
"blood once more?⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Had he learned it really did have miraculous powers and decided "
"he wanted me back?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫O lorde?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Por que ele de novo?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Por que não podia me deixar "
"em paz?⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Depois de tentar me matar durante um de seus sabás de sangue, por que "
"estava atrás do meu sangue mais uma vez?⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Ele tinha descoberto que realmente "
"tinha poderes milagrosos e decidido que me queria de volta?"

#: search2:search2_009BAF82_3397_4AF3_979E_89EE9F284943
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5bc9075b0869c88bc22674aeeabf8c59e1160ad530bb45db79830f645d816c73
#. default-sha256: ba543dfff0706de16b3d9c2b6c4e78aaf968d84145acd1ef38ddf9f6a1f4d586
msgctxt "search2:search2_009BAF82_3397_4AF3_979E_89EE9F284943"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“You get to be the sacrifice...”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Você acabou sendo o sacrifício...”"

#: search2:search2_60680B7F_61CE_4E68_B15B_7CE93D5B6B00
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff9db70e3a1b22b979a31fceb0e8cc75734c506fabf1e644c3466155cbf89bda
#. default-sha256: bfe76655a4c3ee670e36305ac414d371f6983e4ea0a37b61831cd82dd2beb3cc
msgctxt "search2:search2_60680B7F_61CE_4E68_B15B_7CE93D5B6B00"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sacrifice?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Excuse me, ⟪k:5⟫what⟪k:6⟫?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫And what’s all this "
"about “keeping her church from collapsing”?⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫You ⟪k:13⟫murdered⟪k:14⟫ a carriage "
"full of innocent people. ⟪k:15⟫And you’re trying to protect a church? ⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫You?⟪k:18⟫ "
"⟪k:19⟫Are you out of your mind?⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫Churches are where people go to commune with "
"God. ⟪k:23⟫To speak with ⟪k:24⟫my Father⟪k:25⟫!⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫How ⟪k:29⟫dare⟪k:30⟫ you soil "
"those sanctified grounds with your filthy hands, you beast! ⟪k:31⟫It’s insulting. Sacrilegious. "
"Repulsive. ⟪k:32⟫Just what do you think we are?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sacrifício?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Espera aí, ⟪k:5⟫o que⟪k:6⟫?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫E o que é tudo isso "
"sobre “impedir que a igreja dela desmorone”?⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Você ⟪k:13⟫assassinou⟪k:14⟫ uma "
"carruagem cheia de pessoas inocentes. ⟪k:15⟫E está tentando proteger uma igreja? ⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Você?"
"⟪k:18⟫ ⟪k:19⟫Está louco?⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫As igrejas são lugares onde as pessoas vão para ter "
"comunhão com Deus. ⟪k:23⟫Para falar com ⟪k:24⟫meu Pai⟪k:25⟫!⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫Como ⟪k:29⟫"
"ousa⟪k:30⟫ sujar esse solo sagrado com suas mãos imundas, sua besta! ⟪k:31⟫É um insulto. "
"Sacrilégio. Repulsivo. ⟪k:32⟫O que você acha que nós somos?!"

#: search2:search2_22B3A6A2_EE2C_445D_A155_66FC9E7653BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62ffbfae14fef5f2ac8c78ad56b115a4dfd972cccd7d7830d25b6595f146720a
#. default-sha256: f643a87e1adccc601d9334ef11903de5a69a26b2c9ce7ad1e7c41d45b3aecbc4
msgctxt "search2:search2_22B3A6A2_EE2C_445D_A155_66FC9E7653BF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“So don’t take it personally, witch.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Então não leve para o lado pessoal, bruxa.”"

#: search2:search2_6B3EE901_C92B_4091_B63E_750AE2051278
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
