msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫is this⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫happening to me?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Por que⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫isto está⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫acontecendo comigo?"

#: search2:search2_CD4388F1_5987_4EF6_BDF1_30658B184D72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 318d9103ff34060c9c7f2a31983afdb61d89ac39e02fd1af09cbfab742abfce1
#. default-sha256: 99d4a2c95fbbf63c52cfe249e307eb26794565c254a4d7c483e52f3a801c466f
msgctxt "search2:search2_CD4388F1_5987_4EF6_BDF1_30658B184D72"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The man brought me back to the city.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫But "
"instead of taking me to the lord’s manor, he brought me to a church on the city’s outskirts. ⟪k:8⟫"
"Though, to be honest, it looked more like an estate than a church.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫The church "
"also served as a hospital, offering free care to less fortunate children, the poor, and the "
"infirm.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫That was when I learned why he had said they needed money. ⟪k:16⟫"
"The owner of the church offered unconditional assistance to anyone who came. ⟪k:17⟫Even when food "
"and supplies ran low, they would ration their own in order to keep helping others. ⟪k:18⟫As a "
"result, the church was perpetually on the verge of collapse.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫The church was run "
"by a woman—something exceedingly rare for the time. ⟪k:22⟫There were no priests; all management "
"was handled by a single nun, who everyone referred to..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫O homem me trouxe de volta para a cidade.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Mas "
"em vez de me levar para a mansão do lorde, ele me levou para uma igreja nos arredores da cidade. "
"⟪k:8⟫Embora, para ser honesta, parecia mais uma propriedade do que uma igreja.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫A "
"igreja também servia como hospital, oferecendo assistência gratuita a crianças menos afortunadas, "
"pobres e enfermos.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Foi quando descobri por que havia dito que eles "
"precisavam de dinheiro. ⟪k:16⟫O dono da igreja oferecia assistência incondicional a qualquer um "
"que viesse. ⟪k:17⟫Mesmo quando a comida e os suprimentos acabavam, eles racionavam os seus "
"próprios para continuar ajudando os outros. ⟪k:18⟫Como resultado, a igreja estava perpetuamente à "
"beira do colapso.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫A igreja era administrada por uma mulher—algo extremamente "
"raro para a época. ⟪k:22⟫Não havia sacerdotes; toda a gestão era feita por uma única freira, a "
"quem todos se referiam..."

#: search2:search2_544B2421_BBDA_4996_82EA_944EC02CE0C7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0579ec9b25b992a602ce996e3622b63ab3b0a97136b6a8c5d24e40a2a17916a
