msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫as the “Saintess.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫como a “Saintess.”"

#: search2:search2_43C0B809_21F1_4499_8377_5F0F8329F9E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: abf7a842c15e4a32022b89968d2e4fc3a650b84ed81558d9055670b6ff38793c
#. default-sha256: b423177b2c17748044343d192e49b466168de59c4e820a5ccc612f7e88a1c819
msgctxt "search2:search2_43C0B809_21F1_4499_8377_5F0F8329F9E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I remained imprisoned for a long, long time.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫In the beginning, the "
"swordsman guarded me, ⟪k:5⟫though before long, the flaxen-haired young man showed up as well. "
"⟪k:6⟫Presumably one severed arm wasn’t enough to keep his sister healthy for long.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫In listening to their conversations, I learned that, to ensure no one else could get in, "
"the observation tower was sealed with three locks. ⟪k:11⟫The lord, the swordsman, and the young "
"man each held one of the keys. ⟪k:12⟫I was their secret, locked away in the tower for them to "
"drain of blood away from wandering eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eu permaneci presa por muito, muito tempo.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫No começo, o espadachim me "
"guardava, ⟪k:5⟫embora em pouco tempo, o jovem de cabelos linho apareceu também. ⟪k:6⟫"
"Presumivelmente, um braço decepado não foi suficiente para manter sua irmã saudável por muito "
"tempo.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Ao ouvir suas conversas, descobri que, para garantir que ninguém mais "
"pudesse entrar, a torre de observação estava fechada com três fechaduras. ⟪k:11⟫O lorde, o "
"espadachim e o jovem seguravam cada um uma das chaves. ⟪k:12⟫Eu era o segredo deles, trancada na "
"torre para drenarem o sangue, longe de olhos curiosos."

#: search2:search2_CBA47237_0B57_42B9_99C6_0556D4C38363
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6177871fb3a28e422e3e14c464db23e3557b1ed629f6fe89e71e55d9f4057fab
#. default-sha256: 46d647c47631f423c1bdc104c42228a6d314ff5367eec0d4e8477d5f10d00ee9
msgctxt "search2:search2_CBA47237_0B57_42B9_99C6_0556D4C38363"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I heard the flaxen-haired girl’s voice, who had regained her health drinking my blood."
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I heard her brother’s voice, who had betrayed me.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I heard the nun’s "
"voice, who played saint in my stead.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I heard the barbaric swordsman’s voice, who "
"had chopped off my arm.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫And I heard the lord’s voice—the root of all my "
"suffering."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ouvi a voz da garota de cabelos linho, que recuperou sua saúde bebendo meu sangue.⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ouvi a voz de seu irmão, que havia me traído.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Ouvi a voz da freira, que "
"se fez de santa em meu lugar.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Ouvi a voz do espadachim bárbaro, que havia cortado "
"meu braço.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫E ouvi a voz do lorde—a raiz de todo o meu sofrimento."

#: search2:search2_E3E54520_F6D0_4C2E_B309_B045ECD0DCCD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85c2a13739b71b72d5ab799f0b8b0023562eedbd641dbb3f6a09745ab0b3a16e
