msgctxt "search2:search2_4EBFF23F_70C2_4F56_BA17_9588D0C70580"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫As the bell’s last pealing faded into silence, the tower door "
"swung open. ⟪k:7⟫Standing on the other side of it were the three men. ⟪k:8⟫They must have wanted "
"to drain a little more from me to use in the feast, ⟪k:9⟫but they arrived at the worst possible "
"moment.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫The flaxen-haired young man was the first to express his consternation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Quando o último badalar do sino se desvaneceu no silêncio, a "
"porta da torre se abriu. ⟪k:7⟫De pé, do outro lado, estavam os três homens. ⟪k:8⟫Eles deviam "
"querer drenar um pouco mais de mim para usar na festa, ⟪k:9⟫mas chegaram no pior momento possível."
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫O jovem de cabelos linho foi o primeiro a expressar sua consternação."

#: search2:search2_C3C31414_3C27_45F6_A85E_DC497DD51F33
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49e4e6fe41bed601e108537e77780361318d28c81cf5347cba5b856ec7ed8798
