msgctxt "search2:search2_5EF2B737_0293_40B2_83B5_54BF14C686A0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Seal the tower off.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Understood? ⟪k:7⟫No one⟪k:8⟫ finds out "
"about this.”⟪k:9⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Sele a torre.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Entendido? ⟪k:7⟫Ninguém⟪k:8⟫ fica sabendo "
"disso.”⟪k:9⟫"

#: search2:search2_7B3244DD_DD6A_43DE_8C5B_51028EDF8ECC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d17e7ff9eb47e2900351b0fc5ab5502e13ab457a413b68f6baa60e967383dc4
#. default-sha256: 2db6391841baf8270d5ae9f2dbd8e19329c80f2129e3769eaeb53004a99d215d
msgctxt "search2:search2_7B3244DD_DD6A_43DE_8C5B_51028EDF8ECC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Hah. Pinning the blame on me?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫How nice it must be to be able to "
"distort reality with panic.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Hah. Colocando a culpa em mim?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Como deve ser bom poder com o pânico "
"distorcer a realidade.”"

#: search2:search2_F7313451_8123_4687_9901_13E0F33980CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1fd0805bfaf83d0b5eae0c72ca1f6fb4c4bed85f91f99fc850d9edd95dc4b515
#. default-sha256: d1b3797a57e78f247a8b8841e211170b81c6b6f014dc7e34bef65dd8cd868144
msgctxt "search2:search2_F7313451_8123_4687_9901_13E0F33980CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But then,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫in that moment,⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫an ⟪k:8⟫actual⟪k:9⟫ miracle⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫occurred.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫My Father bestowed upon me His power.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫"
"⟪k:19⟫Or perhaps...⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫perhaps it was the Devil...⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫who lent me his "
"strength."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mas então,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫naquele momento,⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫um milagre ⟪k:8⟫real⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫aconteceu.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Meu Pai me concedeu Seu poder.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Ou "
"talvez...⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫talvez tenha sido o Diabo...⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫que me emprestou sua "
"força."

#: search2:search2_832E4FAC_9515_470E_8D33_3D6A211A2163
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 441c830dd618365a9ea05ee958e60b46227dc3b12029a5b4a0963a075b9da968
#. default-sha256: c6603bfc4aa9f5a99527fd9068bccfe79cd01e35e5c7db56078473d2bf981e50
msgctxt "search2:search2_832E4FAC_9515_470E_8D33_3D6A211A2163"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was looking down upon my own dead body. ⟪k:2⟫My own wretched self.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"There was nothing “beautiful” about the pile of bones I had become. ⟪k:6⟫I could almost smell the "
"rotting flesh.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫That⟪k:11⟫ was once a saint?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫I laughed at the "
"thought.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫It was absurd.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Ridiculous.⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫And "
"infuriating.⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫They would pay.⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫Those who had cast me into this "
"hell.⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫Who had mocked me.⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫Who had done this to me.⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫"
"⟪k:38⟫Who had made a witch out of me!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eu estava olhando para o meu próprio cadáver. ⟪k:2⟫Meu próprio eu miserável.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫Não havia nada de  “bonito” na pilha de ossos que eu havia me tornado. ⟪k:6⟫Quase podia "
"sentir o cheiro da carne apodrecendo.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Isso⟪k:11⟫ já foi uma santa?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫Eu ri com a ideia.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Era absurdo.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Ridículo.⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫"
"⟪k:23⟫E enfurecedor.⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫Eles pagariam.⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫Aqueles que me lançaram "
"neste inferno.⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫Que tinham zombado de mim.⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫Que tinham feito isso "
"comigo.⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫Que fizeram de mim uma bruxa!"

#: search2:search2_C9C817C8_0AEF_4221_A51E_A3F659DC9961
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78940148343cc71265afbf4d59989f5b0a5cc657d3748a0724c9b565166d8bb6
#. default-sha256: 4bcd2f322d9fa6b1c9bd70beba454afa9e6955edd5f61ad9a3ea7ed80c66b109
msgctxt "search2:search2_C9C817C8_0AEF_4221_A51E_A3F659DC9961"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hatred coursed through me.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Revulsion at everyone on these grounds still "
"smiling!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫They would know just whose dead shoulders their little party was resting "
"upon...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫If they wanted so badly to call me a witch... ⟪k:11⟫then a witch I would "
"be...⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫I would kill them...⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Every last one of them...⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫"
"⟪k:20⟫Place a curse on their souls!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ódio correu em mim.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Repulsa por todos neste local ainda sorrindo!⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Eles saberiam em quais ombros mortos sua festinha estava descansando...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫"
"Se eles queriam tanto me chamar de bruxa... ⟪k:11⟫então uma bruxa eu seria...⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Eu "
"os mataria...⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Até o último deles...⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Colocar uma maldição em "
"suas almas!"

#: search2:search2_36E1864F_246B_47F9_A6B7_9D796F76EC5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ebd338aa3db49d2dc7894eb3939e8e06acc6e9a758313e78abd3a37b1b472c9
#. default-sha256: b75a4c4d44be226465793be1bc88c186c32a5817fc296c9b101a40f6e93c4484
msgctxt "search2:search2_36E1864F_246B_47F9_A6B7_9D796F76EC5A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The young man let out a yelp as he descended the remainder of the staircase. ⟪k:2⟫As "
"soon as he reached the garden, he lifted the girl in his arms, ⟪k:3⟫but she had already perished."
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Realizing this,⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫he cried to the heavens,⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"saying the one thing he should have kept to himself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫O jovem soltou um grito enquanto descia o restante da escada. ⟪k:2⟫Assim que chegou ao "
"jardim, ele levantou a menina em seus braços, ⟪k:3⟫mas ela já havia perecido.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"Percebendo isso,⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫ele clamou aos céus,⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫dizendo a única coisa que "
"deveria ter guardado para si mesmo."

#: search2:search2_C9EF1025_700F_4735_9376_32D40D132B8F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ebff1f1b6eb74fe67b69bc16df6e81b4b03adf745833dcfc9c25f74a55e48e6a
#. default-sha256: 1c08080245cf95419862bb8204278388a45cb3df51e960aff17f06c723c79203
msgctxt "search2:search2_C9EF1025_700F_4735_9376_32D40D132B8F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“The witch killed her...”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“A bruxa matou ela...”"

#: search2:search2_CF282D4A_F922_453D_9611_E9E33BC11C03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48279303743b48a644738811316b766a9c548e87600e21e04dffbba60c87cbf8
#. default-sha256: 6313ea00a4e5eebc55fb1695048284e6869469854da77e36663351106f05e9d1
msgctxt "search2:search2_CF282D4A_F922_453D_9611_E9E33BC11C03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“The blood of the witch killed my sister!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“O sangue da bruxa matou minha irmã!”"

#: search2:search2_B452B934_50B9_47F3_9906_BE86228BD71C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9214753def01050949537930c9e0959046da987c3248b768ab9aaae4cd59b041
