msgctxt "search2:search2_B452B934_50B9_47F3_9906_BE86228BD71C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“It’s—”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“É—”"

#: search2:search2_89C4334A_B7A2_49BE_AD29_6C93E6F4427E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd8de44ad7661bf64f6eadd4f8358af751febc7bde76df6eb40db7d88a848c47
#. default-sha256: fc94a6ab6b29e12b610b33f9b00390df82ba0a5404072f45dea0b801a80a674b
msgctxt "search2:search2_89C4334A_B7A2_49BE_AD29_6C93E6F4427E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“It’s the blood of the witch!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“É o sangue da bruxa!”"

#: search2:search2_20B7F719_A77B_4C98_AE25_384AFDFEB29B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5179230355553a59d0f990ced7c161b9b8b8a290d4891729321538d2b44ae6c
#. default-sha256: 7f3e9f05778d4b35794e76c1bdb6311f72e673c21004f5ce9bea7a5e66ee8aad
msgctxt "search2:search2_20B7F719_A77B_4C98_AE25_384AFDFEB29B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“You’re all drinking witch blood!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Vocês estão todos bebendo sangue de bruxa!”"

#: search2:search2_0ED2EBDE_430F_424C_BB84_9A6CCC54C9D9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07b90d4d1767266cff464a564fa3a89e3ae69b4e30c881065cf4e3ba31aa5301
#. default-sha256: 3222728be824452ac8ce2d72a4d34341e988c0adce52d84df9fb491cdebdb126
msgctxt "search2:search2_0ED2EBDE_430F_424C_BB84_9A6CCC54C9D9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Crushed by the loss of his only family,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫the young man picked up a silver "
"fork,⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫and plunged it into his own throat,⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫ending his life.⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Naturally, there was an uproar. ⟪k:15⟫Goblets of wine crashed against the earth "
"in rapid succession ⟪k:16⟫as the people holding them fell to the ground and vomited or convulsed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Esmagado pela perda de sua única família,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫o jovem pegou um garfo de prata,"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫e enfiou em sua própria garganta,⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫acabando com sua vida.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Naturalmente, houve um alvoroço. ⟪k:15⟫Taças de vinho bateram contra a terra em "
"rápida sucessão ⟪k:16⟫enquanto as pessoas que as seguravam caíam no chão e vomitavam ou "
"convulsionavam."

#: search2:search2_512A7DE4_CCC0_4DBB_A2B1_57FC9D21C9DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 629e69721a48a4e08bfbc07adf0742bc97b49a9a1fa8059c3f4a0ad7d9d5cd27
#. default-sha256: 280baf6d1a775ec436c8764a1d46dc63d8d38265d1c7ab047cbf7703c222efa2
msgctxt "search2:search2_512A7DE4_CCC0_4DBB_A2B1_57FC9D21C9DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And he looked down upon it all from the safety of the observation tower. ⟪k:2⟫He could "
"do nothing but watch as his domain burned. ⟪k:3⟫I can only imagine how painful that must have "
"been.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫But before long, having seemingly have made his peace, he began descending "
"the spiral staircase. ⟪k:7⟫He opened the door at the bottom, revealing himself to his people.⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫But before the door had swung all the way open—⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫before he had "
"had a chance to say his final words—⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫someone ran a blade through his chest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E ele olhou para tudo isso da segurança da torre de observação. ⟪k:2⟫Não podia fazer "
"nada além de assistir enquanto seu domínio queimava. ⟪k:3⟫Eu só posso imaginar o quão doloroso "
"deve ter sido.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Mas em pouco tempo, tendo aparentemente aceitado a situação, começou "
"a descer a escada em espiral. ⟪k:7⟫Ele abriu a porta na base, revelando-se ao seu povo.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Mas antes que a porta se abrisse completamente—⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫antes que ele "
"tivesse a chance de dizer suas últimas palavras—⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫alguém enfiou uma lâmina em seu "
"peito."

#: search2:search2_F93C46F0_5ABF_46D2_B67A_CB6F268B8FD0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f6ce0aba700ec4af1d27570b6f5b0a0b7c257248ec79db6911b80edf352c32a
#. default-sha256: 1a7596d4e860a5292f0c154494c52e4389c650f1bc606cb707d82a9f570f5107
msgctxt "search2:search2_F93C46F0_5ABF_46D2_B67A_CB6F268B8FD0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫In less than a week, ⟪k:2⟫the entire city was dead."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Em menos de uma semana, ⟪k:2⟫toda a cidade estava morta."

#: search2:search2_F7FE30AB_96EA_4033_8751_05E485BA8BF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf035ecf94e384f3967e5680448afd0acd5916133564a0e5d1711bc7fb67de1b
#. default-sha256: afa71556c143103467f66b7657a1fa0c432fbbfe128059e95ac2da7888646325
msgctxt "search2:search2_F7FE30AB_96EA_4033_8751_05E485BA8BF0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It’s possible...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫that⟪k:6⟫ was no miracle either.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫You "
"can easily explain what happened to them.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Locked away for so long in that dirty "
"tower, maybe I caught some kind of disease. ⟪k:13⟫And then, when the people drank my blood, they "
"too were infected. ⟪k:14⟫Hardly anything out of the ordinary about that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫É possível...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫que ⟪k:5⟫isso⟪k:6⟫ não fosse nenhum milagre, também.⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Você pode facilmente explicar o que aconteceu com eles.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Trancada por "
"tanto tempo naquela torre suja, talvez eu tenha pegado algum tipo de doença. ⟪k:13⟫E então, "
"quando as pessoas beberam meu sangue, elas também foram infectadas. ⟪k:14⟫Dificilmente algo fora "
"do comum."

#: search2:search2_E5F8CCFB_DD57_4BFB_B819_ABA67E64CFC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e9cb74c84600768ca20578fd723869abeb08cf18b10512ae738815814218e06c
#. default-sha256: 798334ffb92154bb9f0e60f07f95922a32211de844abc42b00eb82e77824c563
msgctxt "search2:search2_E5F8CCFB_DD57_4BFB_B819_ABA67E64CFC6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The first to die, the girl, had already been ill. ⟪k:2⟫Her body merely chose the worst "
"possible time to yield to her ailment. ⟪k:3⟫That was all that had happened.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"Indeed...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫It was nothing more than a fluke. ⟪k:11⟫An improbable stroke of luck. "
"⟪k:12⟫An unbelievably unfortunate accident for the city and those three men—and an indescribably "
"fortunate accident for myself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A primeira a morrer, a menina, já estava doente. ⟪k:2⟫Seu corpo apenas escolheu o pior "
"momento possível para ceder à sua doença. ⟪k:3⟫Isso foi tudo o que aconteceu.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"De fato...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Não passou de um acaso. ⟪k:11⟫Um golpe improvável de sorte. ⟪k:12⟫Um "
"acidente incrivelmente infeliz para a cidade e aqueles três homens—e um acidente "
"indescritivelmente feliz para mim."

#: search2:search2_1A9627D9_FB02_4D50_B56E_83F2795B45B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af6587975ced9a90dd1e90a209bc3d8446e218239e1ed91286bb1aa2b660b5ac
#. default-sha256: 3172b001f0a79c8092508b08d8b8f5b8f7e976b8e49d676340c286c2c0be7b57
msgctxt "search2:search2_1A9627D9_FB02_4D50_B56E_83F2795B45B6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫My curse had brought death upon the three men, ⟪k:6⟫but for "
"whatever reason... ⟪k:7⟫my rancor was far from sated.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫They had died. ⟪k:11⟫So what?"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Death is but a transient agony.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫It’s nothing compared to what "
"I went through."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Minha maldição trouxe a morte sobre os três homens, ⟪k:6⟫mas por "
"alguma razão... ⟪k:7⟫meu rancor estava longe de ser saciado.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Eles tinham morrido. "
"⟪k:11⟫E daí?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫A morte é apenas uma agonia transitória.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Não é "
"nada comparado ao que eu passei."

#: search2:search2_257E9F43_4644_4F36_BE58_C450D9C14FDE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54898398724453607370c075e0abde81cd8e696c28aab4c41e23b84f7775fb3d
#. default-sha256: 199ce2fa403abae016d54dfc6f758780d1c4aab78ec53cc8cd9434f808f41a4f
msgctxt "search2:search2_257E9F43_4644_4F36_BE58_C450D9C14FDE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫This was my wish for the beast-like man:⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫He was conscious of his "
"tendency for violence, and he yearned to be more human, ⟪k:6⟫so I had his inner beast toned up "
"just a little. ⟪k:7⟫I saw to it that he would never be human—⟪k:8⟫so he would never have the "
"peace he so desired!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Este foi o meu desejo para o homem bestial:⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ele estava consciente de "
"sua tendência à violência e ansiava por ser mais humano, ⟪k:6⟫então eu fiz sua fera interior só "
"um pouco tonificada. ⟪k:7⟫Eu cuidei para que ele nunca fosse humano—⟪k:8⟫para que ele nunca "
"tivesse a paz que tanto desejava!"

#: search2:search2_DBEA9936_136E_409F_856B_2241929345BA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
